":"Seael","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3784185","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3784185","b":"Tatoeba sentence #3784185 by Seael; English translation #312979 by \\N","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/3784185","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Ninguna lengua extranjera a menos que el idioma es hablado por todos.","e":"No foreign language unless the language is spoken by all.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"7761cd231b2f900ed61fc80935288b71","i":"6fbbc2b968e286a1fd1db2eacfb2d644","r":"3553976:6762733:370:320889","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3553976","6762733","370"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Se necesita mucha práctica para dominar una lengua extranjera.","e":"It takes a great deal of practice to master a foreign language.","s":"tatoeba","x":"d58292fd222367fd3ef23e4895fd7818","i":"918cb0c8bcdaa3745db85ea2643016a8","r":"637364:21900","c":"Leono","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/637364","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/637364","b":"Tatoeba sentence #637364 by Leono; English translation #21900 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/637364","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Esta noche vamos a ver una película extranjera.","e":"We're going to see a foreign film tonight.","s":"tatoeba","x":"1e3a36be7eec516a2a1ad779cebdf064","i":"91d354ed999355ce1a1f51666aed07f8","r":"1695618:680998","c":"marcelostockle","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1695618","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1695618","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1695618 by marcelostockle; English translation #680998 by Source_VOA","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1695618","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Ahora tengo que encontrarme contigo en esta ciudad extranjera.","e":"Now I have to meet you in this foreign city.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"b8c06fafd1b09e24b0de2eaa27c54372","i":"95ab7c84416e444de8db2777760f60ae","r":"4399594:6577722:1095:665958","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4399594","6577722","1095"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Los militares y la ayuda extranjera están exentos.","e":"Military and foreign aid are exempted.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"32f57e62263c84b5150aa8961e4de83d","i":"d98cb11fa80dc7a49277435ed7993c52","r":"5338022:7030563:67:3176365","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5338022","7030563","67"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Sin su participación, nuestra presencia aquí nunca será más que una ocupación extranjera.","e":"Without your active involvement, our presence here will never be anything more than a foreign occupation.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"c095a0239a3b3c1f65373bc3de13184d","i":"512f0dd6a0d98225334ec82be712ef33","r":"4758646:6994085:1467:3073851","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4758646","6994085","1467"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"El espionaje y el romance en una localidad extranjera.","e":"Espionage and romance in a foreign locale.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a62997d9275027ae44c6586b67a6dfa2","i":"d0652cb5a1045461f8d065cb8aa1077b","r":"5024738:6661238:387:1359403","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5024738","6661238","387"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Bien, el FBI dice que es para apoyar a una organización terrorista extranjera.","e":"Well, the FBI is saying it's material support for a foreign terrorist organization.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a7a99bea5ef677259ca7efb81f6bc18d","i":"0deb183d24d3a397bfdaee1b4ef23dc3","r":"5314806:6863358:165:3164487","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5314806","6863358","165"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"No es fácil aprender una lengua extranjera.","e":"It isn't easy to learn a foreign language.","s":"tatoeba","x":"e2d4c9c2002470add58fb2578327d677","i":"03e0e6803dbdc0ecf62a710101a588db","r":"712897:456143","c":"Shishir","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/712897","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/712897","b":"Tatoeba sentence #712897 by Shishir; English translation #456143 by lukaszpp","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/71